            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>When two fractions have the same denominator, we add the numerators. For example, \n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac 1 7 + \\dfrac 5 7 = \\dfrac{1+5}{7} = \\dfrac 6 7.]</span>\nIn this case, both fractions were over a common denominator of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 7]</span>.</p>",
