          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We have a common denominator of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2a,]</span> so we add the numerators and simplify:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (2 + a)/(2a) + (3 + 2a)/(2a)|=; (2 + a + 3 + 2a)/(2a)|=; (2 + 3 + a + 2a)/(2a)|=; (5 + 3a)/(2a)]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We have a common denominator of [MATH: 2a,] so we add the numerators and simplify:\n\n[MATH: (2 + a)/(2a) + (3 + 2a)/(2a)|=; (2 + a + 3 + 2a)/(2a)|=; (2 + 3 + a + 2a)/(2a)|=; (5 + 3a)/(2a)]",
